agg=max combines rows that share a category.

@graph(type=bar, x=section, y=score, agg=max)
@data
section,score
A,70
A,80
B,65
B,90
B,75
C,85
@end

stack stacks a bar chart's series instead of grouping them.

@graph(type=bar, x=team, y=Spring;Fall, stack)
@data
team,Spring,Fall
Red,40,55
Blue,25,30
Green,35,20
@end

